     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Common tool categories",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Most product teams rely on tools across these categories, though the specific products vary by organization:",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 169,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Research and insights platforms",
     "el": "strong"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "—Platforms that capture feedback from multiple channels: in-app surveys, NPS tools, feature request boards, and customer advisory programs.",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Customer feedback tools",
     "el": "strong"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 165,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Support and CRM systems",
     "el": "strong"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 166,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Analytics platforms",
     "el": "strong"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 132,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Project management and roadmapping tools",
     "el": "strong"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "—Wikis, messaging platforms, and shared drives where decisions, meeting notes, and strategy documents live.",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Communication and documentation tools",
     "el": "strong"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Identifying the gaps",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 294,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "This exercise almost always reveals gaps. Common ones include:",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Research findings that influenced a decision but were shared verbally or in a slide deck rather than linked to the roadmap item",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Customer feedback sitting in a support tool that the product team never saw",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Usage data that contradicted the team's assumptions but wasn't surfaced until after launch",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Duplicate research—teams running studies on questions that had already been answered months earlier in a different context",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "These gaps define the integration priorities.",
     "el": "p"
