     "role": "h2",
     "text": "Common integration patterns for product ops",
     "el": "h2"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "While every team's stack is different, a few integration patterns come up repeatedly in product ops.",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Research repository ↔ Project management",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 196,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Support/CRM ↔ Research repository",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 229,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Feedback tool ↔ Research repository",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 150,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Analytics ↔ Project management",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 152,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Communication tool ↔ Research repository",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 161,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h2",
     "text": "Governance and maintenance",
     "el": "h2"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Integration is not a one-time project. Product ops teams need to plan for ongoing governance.",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Assign ownership",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 192,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Review periodically",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "At least quarterly, product ops should audit the tool stack and its integrations. Questions to ask:",
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Are teams actually using the integrated data, or is it being ignored?",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Have any workflows changed in ways that make existing integrations irrelevant?",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Are there new gaps that have emerged as the team or product has evolved?",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "text": "Is the tagging taxonomy still serving its purpose, or has it drifted?",
     "el": "li"
    },
    {
     "role": "h3",
     "text": "Document everything",
     "el": "h3"
    },
    {
     "role": "text",
     "placeholder": true,
     "chars": 343,
     "el": "p"
    },
    {
